Z||000006||rockcrawl||07-26-2000||09:24 PM||||Yeah, you could buy a Vette for that kind of money (and it probably doesn't have a cup holder either, not to mention a spare tire!), but then you'd just have a Vette like all 10 of the others I saw today. Trust me, the Lambo draws a crowd like no Vette ever could, and it doesn't matter if it has four cylinders or twelve. Everyone, young or old, will turn their head to get a second look at a Diablo.<P>Jon<P>------------------<BR>'86 GT 3800<BR>'87 GT<BR>Rossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||7
