Z||000008||Monkeyman||07-27-2000||02:08 AM||||A C5 doesn't need a spare.  It's shod in run-flats.<P>There's a gentleman in southern Ohio who is working on a Lambo kit based on an '87 GT.  He has $25k in it already and claims to need another $12k to finish it.  That's 37 thousand dollars!  Waaaaay too much.  I didn't pay much more than that for my house and you can't live in a Lambo (although I'd have to if my wife ever found out I spent that much money on a car).||||reg||1
Z||000009||olympic||07-27-2000||03:25 AM||||  Its at $50,600 now.  Thats nuts.<P>   Actually, it was cars like this one that got me interested in Fieros in the first place.  When I finally realized that I'd never be able to afford to build a Diablo kit I started to look into Fieros and realized how much potential they have at a descent price.<P>   I still drewl every time I see a Diablo though(kit or real).  It is the sexiest and most beautiful car ever built, bar none.<P>------------------<BR>Your best...???  Losers whine about doing their best.   Winners go home and f*** the prom queen! - Sean Connery in "The Rock"||||reg||1
